    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44de75341de9ca2f49e9be0f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“大阪杯”当天。已经得知\n樱花千代王状况的八重无敌，\n向目白阿尔丹发表胜利宣言。",
      "source_fingerprint": "57fed0574fb4c4c26326f08f87e68e7b386c99409e25ec3990a92554d135890f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
