    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28de425b41052d2612b4a5f8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“宝冢纪念”的几天前，樱花千代王\n在憧憬的对象丸善斯基的协助下，\n进行最后的调整。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1457b8981a124314f3090e42e4c44d05c2025cdcc418a10a901d8c4fff9c35f3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1071/storytimeline_501071415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cbd498db03cf6c18c181975",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1071/storytimeline_501071415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02b66e1dcb2b0ece5c7142b0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "樱花千代王表示是因为有劲敌在，\n自己才能够回来参加比赛，丸善斯基笑着\n对参加“宝冢纪念”的她送上祝福。",
      "source_fingerprint": "857449fa86c8cdcdade2cab77b026e7ca311bbe4d358da0aafe72ec4befd2f2e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1071/storytimeline_501071415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3bdf3989d98a38a05722e88b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1071/storytimeline_501071415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8beda02d19aa4d08dbc6f273",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "到了“宝冢纪念”当天。在目白阿尔丹\n她们庆祝三人再次重逢时，最近表现\n十分亮眼的稻荷一来到她们面前。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a71a2a2542f170a014fdc801dae4f5f2751b827acbb42b9b0834c64fa0c972af",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1071/storytimeline_501071415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:345e105a3008ebd85c599147",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1071/storytimeline_501071415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d8f03fc21010f125e49216e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "稻荷一向目白阿尔丹等人宣战，\n目白阿尔丹从对手散发的压迫感，\n察觉到这些话是认真的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f44318f4dddd67b96ce009f63c9d2e0af325cd47c152848ee89a64714e34a7f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1071/storytimeline_501071415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1d806525b2d770671308521",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1071/storytimeline_501071415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41dd25907273009d503abac8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但目白阿尔丹她们全都\n不害怕稻荷一。反而对新的强敌\n感到欣喜不已，前往参加比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf06383891ecc2388d7b387c758fa7f25b437de09440786362288ee13b79fd41",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1071/storytimeline_501071415.json",
      "json_path": [
