    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:105b611881c9e4513b2b1734",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“每日王冠”当天。观众的注意力\n都集中在目白阿尔丹、小栗帽和\n稻荷一的激战上──",
      "source_fingerprint": "a51b2a00389d71814476f9ca28f384a04bba4eb8aed38dcf36bbc7bfc9bb0687",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1071/storytimeline_501071416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39dc99c0c5089253d1b6ea04",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "此时，目白阿尔丹表示最近流行\n将小栗帽、超级溪流和稻荷一\n称作“永世三强”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "226e3c74d8a0bef930f209118040acbbb52796a00df98da4222b8f0ceacce5cd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1071/storytimeline_501071416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa5468c4e4f1c9b7d9e629c5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白阿尔丹斗志满满地表示\n这个名号非常值得推翻，\n准备在比赛中挑战三强的成员。",
      "source_fingerprint": "02dab197230a7fec951c7449ea7c15be680af2b9c6c1021e1d1ab19fcc0b89c3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1071/storytimeline_501071416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
