    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da1c50f7ddeb0703691512b6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在“天皇赏（秋）”的决战前夕。\n目白阿尔丹吐露心声，表示能和训练员\n一起走到今天这一步非常幸福。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f65e2e2ccd439f88f464864ab5becddcfe0d435e2e9f27dc064e5a7d3995749",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
