    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e04de219614020a1ad11dc95",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但她最大的目的是覆盖姐姐的足迹，\n于是重新集中精神，\n朝“青叶赏”迈进……",
      "source_fingerprint": "efa0ca25adcee5199241d0553925164b3ce9a1b54a893cb02536256d85435d1a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1071/storytimeline_501071420.json",
