      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但与此同时，和她对决的\n八重无敌和樱花千代王的表现，\n也在她心里留下了深刻的印象。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3f307fb8104c2ec7473079580420febb21a5fd33542f71184be8053b49bd088",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
