      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白阿尔丹没有因此自满，\n发誓会将今天获得的结果延续到\n青叶赏和更之后的“日本德比”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc5e4acda3fa0b4e512a177eddab9ee6868c39d0d5d2ae34bad409500a668d22",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
