      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "两人也决心要把“皋月赏”的结果\n化为养分，重新振作，\n下次一定要在“日本德比”获胜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "76da6e1a7afabc00cf5da54362550801cf0850dcae09bf075b1d8138af06e0ab",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
